            "pk": "18070683965321920",
            "text": "🇰🇿 Kazakhstan joins Digital Startup Awards\n\nDigital Startup Awards is about uniting strong players of startup ecosystems to give entrepreneurs in the region more opportunities to grow.\n\nOur partners in Kazakhstan are Astana Hub and MOST Hub — two of the country’s key forces driving innovation and entrepreneurship.\n\n🤝 Astana Hub is the innovation cluster in Central Asia, dedicated to building and developing an ecosystem for the tech industry, training highly skilled tech professionals, and supporting startup projects. Today, the hub is home to more than 1700 tech companies, including over 450 with foreign participation. \n\n🤝 MOST Hub - a private ecosystem for startups and venture investors. The company develops a full cycle of support: from idea and prototype to scaling and attracting capital. The group includes: MOST Ventures venture fund, MOST IT Hub agile space, MOST NeoBank digital financial service, MOST Investors’ Club, and MOST Business Intelligence business incubator.\n\nTogether, we will support teams ready to scale, exchange knowledge, and build products in demand beyond their home countries. \n\n💻Digital Startup Awards — where regional ideas meet global ambition 🚀\n\n⏳ Registration is closing in 2 days — don’t miss your chance to apply! (https://startupbase.uz/ru/digital-startup-awards)"
        },
